Revision history for Ex-Op

0.05    2026-11-04
        - Make the empty my list case of the make test at run time, since my () does not compile before perl 5.22
        - Skip the deparse test before perl 5.14, where a custom op has no class for B::Deparse to follow
        - Accept "Not a CODE reference" for a call to a sub undefined after it was made an op, which is what perl before 5.16 says

0.04    2026-11-03
        - Accept a return inside a block or a loop, unwinding as perl's return does
        - Decline an anon sub for what it captures, not for the clone flag the debugger sets on every one
        - Normalise a string eval location with its file and line in the oracle tests, as under Devel::Cover
        - Skip the thread test under Devel::Cover, which refuses threads
	- Improve test coverage to 100%

0.03    2026-10-22
        - Fix a sub with a signature being made an op on perl 5.44

0.02    2026-10-22
        - Fix loading on perls before 5.16 (hv_deletes)
        - Fix a crash on 5.20 and 5.22 when an op dies inside a sub
        - Fix a sub's depth after an op dies inside it while it recurses, before 5.24
        - Fix the name of the op before 5.14
        - Fix tests for older Exporter, Carp and B, and s///r before 5.14

0.01    2026-10-21
        - First version.
